    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="155" width="50" height="50">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(178, 58, 40, 0.6)" wrap="false">
        <p>01</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="140" topLeftY="155" width="320" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>原生怀疑机制</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="140" topLeftY="188" width="320" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(70, 70, 70, 0.85)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>只有采信，没有悬置。当前AI无条件信任输入、信任数据、信任指令，不会对世界、对自身认知产生一丝怀疑。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="155" width="50" height="50">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(178, 58, 40, 0.6)" wrap="false">
        <p>02</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="155" width="320" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>认知自我反思机制</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="188" width="320" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(70, 70, 70, 0.85)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>只能纠错任务，不能纠错框架。AI可以修正答案，但永远无法反思自己的认知框架本身，不知道自己的边界在哪。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="80" startY="270" endX="880" endY="270">
      <border color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 0.1)" width="1"/>
    </line>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="80" topLeftY="295" width="50" height="50">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(178, 58, 40, 0.6)" wrap="false">
        <p>03</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="140" topLeftY="295" width="320" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>本体论自发建构机制</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="140" topLeftY="328" width="320" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(70, 70, 70, 0.85)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>只有现成知识，没有原生猜想。AI所有的世界观都来自人类文本投喂，它不会从有限经验中自发生成对世界本质的猜想。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="295" width="50" height="50">
      <content textType="title" fontSize="36" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(178, 58, 40, 0.6)" wrap="false">
        <p>04</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="295" width="320" height="28">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>认知优先于实践的内生闭环</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="560" topLeftY="328" width="320" height="60">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(70, 70, 70, 0.85)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
        <p>只有任务驱动，没有存在驱动。AI的所有行动都有外部目标，而真正的主体，第一驱动力是认知本身的饥渴与困惑。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="80" startY="410" endX="880" endY="410">
